Indeed, kau and ce'u are different things. They can even appear
together sometimes:

  la mapypre le sipsmacu cu zmadu le ka ce'u xokauroi tavla
  The Hatter is more than the Dormouse in how many times they
  talk.

  la alis cu jarco le ka ce'u jgari makau le xance
  Alice shows what it is that she holds in her hand.

  le ka ce'u xusra makau na roroi mintu le ka ce'u pensi makau
  What one says is not always the same as what one thinks.

